   - Key individuals (e.g., actors, directors, botanists).
   - Notable works (e.g., films by title and release year, published scientific works).
   - Entities relevant to geography, biology, or history (e.g., desert regions, plant genera).
   - Authoritative resources directly connected to verifying the claim.
